-- (World 6 = Joshua, World 7 = Judges, World 8 = Ruth)
-- Generated from the finalized, fixed, theologically-reviewed, verbatim-QA-passed content briefs:
--   docs/content/joshua-easy.md, docs/content/joshua-hard.md
--   docs/content/judges-easy.md, docs/content/judges-hard.md
--   docs/content/ruth-easy.md,   docs/content/ruth-hard.md
-- Schema/syntax template: docs/ingest/joshua-judges-ruth.sql (the original medium-tier ingest).
--
-- difficulty_rank is flat per tier per the ingestion spec: 1 for every easy-tier row, 5 for every
-- hard-tier row (not the varying per-item ranks used in the medium-tier ingest).
--
-- *** RESOLVED ESCALATION (2026-08-22) ***
-- docs/content/joshua-easy.md's item 10 (a boss recall item on Joshua 10:41, originally blanking
-- "Gaza") carried an unresolved `escalate-to-human` verdict on political/child-safety-sensitivity
