-- 2026-08-08 sign-off) resolved it 2026-08-22 by choosing the review's preferred option: the blanked
-- token moves to "Gibeon" instead, same verse, same format. See the addendum at the bottom of
-- `docs/reviews/joshua-easy-review.md` and the updated item 10 row in
-- `docs/qa/joshua-easy-verbatim-qa.md`. Joshua-easy therefore ships with all 10 items below.
